  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 7 — Grid of grey mobile wireframes comparing models \"Ada\", \"Babbage\", \"Curie\" and \"WireGen\" (columns) on two prompts (rows): \"general settings page\" (ranging from a sparse Add Location screen, a plain Settings list, and a Settings/More Apps tabbed screen with checkboxes, to WireGen's General Settings with Backup/Restore, Appearance, Notify Me, Send Feedback and About Us items with descriptions) and \"welcome page\" (from a title with an image placeholder to WireGen's Welcome screen with image, Twitter/Facebook buttons and Sign In/Sign Up buttons).",
